**Evaluating implementation issues**

I see that P004 is mostly implemented, but there’s an issue with how toggles activate. When I tap and send Enter, does it correctly activate the focused button? In Flutter, IconButton does stay focused, so that might work. However, the current implementation seems to fail some requirements around hover, focus, and press states — especially with text squeezing due to layout issues.

The requirement specifies a stable icon at the left without squeezing title text, which isn’t happening. I might need to implement this as an overlay instead of using a Row to avoid altering text width. I'll also need to check the existing design tokens for "headingCollapse."
